{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/png","filename":"intelligence.png","id":"852771138186903572","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/852770541098237992/852771138186903572-intelligence.png","message_id":"852771138484305990","sha256":"e7f538fd03ab74b248422ef9b260287c25aef4f898aea467e8f82015e31b357a","size":258451,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/852770541098237992/852771138186903572/intelligence.png?ex=6ac08903&is=6abf3783&hm=2242fa862a140f532eb4b77cc939be7906b45d9bd84a03c11736127887020257&"}],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852770541098237992","content":"This booth is build around a giant tree who is also its attendant. A few prizes line the walls, but otherwise there seems to be no obvious game. “Welcome…...fellow mage…...how well do you know……..your spells……... and all that they……... require?” He speaks slowly, painfully so.","created_at":"2021-06-11T04:48:03.136000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"852771138484305990","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852770541098237992","content":"**Rules: Guess the spell based on the components (make an intelligence check, no modifier)\n\n3 tries per day.\n\nLimit one of each prize per player.**\n\n**If lost (roll 18 or lower on all 3) post:**\n“Deepest…….of…….condolences………….. It seems……… as if…...you are……..in need……. of further………. studying……. Of the arcane………...arts.”\n\n**DC 19**\n**1 correct** -A monocle that prohibits you from speaking in words that are less than 4 syllables.\nIf won, post: “It looks……….as if……………you know……..a few things………….about…...magic! Here…….. Is a……………..monocle. It…….. makes you……...sound……..smarter……...than you are.”\n\n**2 correct-** Tricorn hat of thought . This hat allows you to remember historical events with near perfect accuracy. (Adv on history checks)\nIf won post: “Well……………...well……….well. Quite……...impressive!” He hands you a tricorn hat. “This……..hat……...helps one…….remember……….better.”\n\n**3 correct**- Poor Richard's Almanac (attuned). A guide book and record of the past that allows you to see trajectories easier and your spell casting range for ranged spells increases by 10ft\nIf won, post: “Astonishing!........you seem……...to really……...know a lot……….about the……… arcane.” He hands you a book entitled ‘Poor Richards’ Almanac’ and continues “Perhaps……… you will……..find this……..as interesting……..as I……….did.”","created_at":"2021-06-11T04:49:09.075000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T16:21:06.401000Z","id":"852771415051993130","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
